  "jobTitle": "Senior Software Engineer",
  "summary": "Senior software engineer with experience across software consulting, enterprise systems, and performance engineering. I specialize in building and optimizing systems that support mission-critical workloads, with a focus on scalability, reliability, and measurable business impact.\n\nPart of my early career included working as a software consultant, delivering feature development on ERP platforms and PHP-based e-commerce systems. In this role, I worked directly with clients to translate business requirements into production software, owning features end-to-end while balancing timelines, maintainability, and real-world operational needs.\n\nAt Hewlett Packard Enterprise, I’m a Senior Performance Software Engineer leading performance analysis and optimization across CPU, memory, I/O, and networking in large-scale distributed systems. My work has driven improvements in latency and throughput and has directly supported multimillion-dollar sales by validating performance capabilities and addressing customer questions pre-purchase.",
