    "description": "Software consultant with experience delivering customer-facing and enterprise software across ERP platforms and e-commerce systems. I worked closely with clients and internal teams to design, build, and ship features that supported critical business operations and revenue-generating workflows.\n\nMy background includes feature development and customization on ERP platforms, helping organizations adapt complex systems to their operational needs, improve efficiency, and support integrations. I also developed and maintained PHP-based e-commerce applications, contributing backend functionality, improving reliability, and supporting high-volume transactional systems.\n\nAs a consultant, I was trusted to own features end-to-end—from requirements gathering through delivery—while balancing timelines, technical trade-offs, and long-term maintainability. This experience built a strong foundation in stakeholder communication, pragmatic engineering, and delivering software that aligns technical execution with business outcomes.",
